    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ălastor</span></b> , ŏris,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάστωρ</span> (a
		tormentor). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One of the companions of Sarpedon</i>, <i>king of Lycia</i>, <i>killed by
				Ulysses before Troy</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 13,
				257</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Name of one of the four horses in the chariot of
				Pluto</i>, Cland. R. Pros. 1, 284.</div>
